  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Appendix'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/DFOpportunities-VendorLevelProfitability/Appendix?rev=' id='Appendix' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/DFOpportunities-VendorLevelProfitability' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1440' minheight='800' minwidth='1440' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='62638' x='556' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Vendor Profitability Dashboard - Appendix</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>This dashboard provides a comprehensive and easily downloadable list of vendors by country with relative monthly Unit Economics. The list can be found in the tab “Vendor Level View”.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>For each vendor the following KPIs are displayed:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Chain ID</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Chain Name</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Vendor ID</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Vendor Name</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- City</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Vendor Vertical: Food, Local Store, Dmart, or Courier</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Vendor GPO Cluster: this is defined based on the vendor’s latest monthly GPO and how it compares vs the avg GPO of the top vendor quartile (top 25% vendors by GMV, </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>aka Class A vendors</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>):</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>     - “Above” if vendor’s monthly avg GPO &gt;= Class A avg GPO</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'><![CDATA[     - “Below” if vendor’s monthly avg GPO < Class A avg GPO]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>     - “Non-class A” if vendor is not part of the top 25%</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Please not that if multiple periods are selected for the analysis, the cluster tag still remains based on the latest month’s GPO and not on the average of the selected months</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Total orders for selected period</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Total GMV for selected period</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Total Gross Profit (GP) for selected period</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Average Unit Economics for selected period (if not otherwise specified, source is Central Data Warehouse):</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- AFV (Average Food Value): GFV/Orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- AOV (Average Order Value): GMV/Orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Commission Revenue per order</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- CR%: calculated as Commission Revenue over Commissionable Base</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- DF per Order: user paid amount </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>[excludes DF amounts covered by vendors]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Take-in per Order: sum of all revenues per order (includes other revenues)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Delivery CPO: from Logistics Database</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Semi-Variable Delivery CPO: from Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Other CPO: from Lucanet</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- GPO: Take-in less Total CPO</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- DH basket incentives per order</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Other basket incentives per order</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- FLGPO: GPO less DH basket incentives per order</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- DH DF incentives per order: for reconciliation of DF</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- Other DF incentives per order: for reconciliation of DF</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>The data can be filtered by month, vertical, city, vendor name (multiple selection available), country and vendor GPO cluster (single selection available)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>The Chain View tab replicates the same structured but grouping vendors by chain for a more high-level view and better performance (less rows). </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>A Sub-Entity View tab is also available for a quick glance at country averages. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='90750' id='5' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/OD_non_LS.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='36250' x='63194' y='8250'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7250' id='6' type-v2='text' w='36250' x='63194' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>GP &amp; FLGP Calculation for Own Delivery (Excluding Local Stores)</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
